AI Resume Analyzer
A web app that gives students instant AI-based feedback on their resume.

Problem
Most students send the same resume everywhere without any feedback, and paid resume reviews are expensive. This tool gives quick, free feedback.

Features
- Upload your resume (PDF)
- Extracts text from the resume
- AI analysis of strengths, gaps and improvements

Tech Stack
- Frontend: React (Vite)
- Backend: Node.js, Express
- AI: (Goggle Gemini API)

How to Run

Backend:
cd server
npm install
node index.js

Frontend:
cd client
npm install
npm run dev

Create a .env file in the server folder with your API key.
